itself; it is regenerated with scripts/update_tlds.py.

This product includes data from MITRE ATT&CK(R): src/insight/data/attack-enterprise.json
lists the techniques and tactics of Enterprise ATT&CK, regenerated with
scripts/update_attack.py from https://github.com/mitre-attack/attack-stix-data.
